   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for bending the Curves</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den 19 maj arrangerar The Foundation for design and Sustainable Enterprise event Bending the Curves i Stockholm. Bending the Curves arrangeras i samband med The Nobel laureate dialogue on Global Sustainability. Forumet samlar ca 300 ledande personer fr&#xe5;n stat, n&#xe4;ringslivet och civilsamh&#xe4;llet f&#xf6;r att diskutera gemensamma &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rdet f&#xf6;r att minska negativa milj&#xf6;trender.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity does not have a description. You can contact Sida for more information. Call +46 8 698 50 00 or send an e-mail to sida@sida.se.</narrative>
  </description>
